1
00:00:13,460 --> 00:00:17,739
Evening settles a little slower now

2
00:00:17,739 --> 00:00:21,600
Same old lane, we walk on down

3
00:00:21,600 --> 00:00:25,140
Dry leaves rustle by the gate

4
00:00:25,140 --> 00:00:28,600
