8
00:00:38,159 --> 00:00:41,600
That little laugh again

9
00:00:41,600 --> 00:00:45,399
No matter how the seasons roll

10
00:00:45,399 --> 00:00:50,579
Some small things don't grow old

11
00:00:50,579 --> 00:00:54,600
Leave the porch light on tonight

12
00:00:54,600 --> 00:00:57,520
