18
00:01:35,780 --> 00:01:39,219
Soft steps passing by the tree

19
00:01:39,219 --> 00:01:43,519
Nothing here runs all too fast

20
00:01:43,519 --> 00:01:47,219
That's why the good things stay

21
00:01:47,219 --> 00:01:49,739
A wooden chair beside the door

22
00:01:49,739 --> 00:01:53,519
Same friendly wave we knew before

23
00:01:53,519 --> 00:01:57,519
